  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "36",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esau's Descendants",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the account of the family line of Esau (that is, Edom).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau took his wives from the women of Canaan: Adah daughter of Elon the Hittite, and Oholibamah daughter of Anah and granddaughter of Zibeon the Hivite—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "also Basemath daughter of Ishmael and sister of Nebaioth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adah bore Eliphaz to Esau, Basemath bore Reuel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Oholibamah bore Jeush, Jalam and Korah. These were the sons of Esau, who were born to him in Canaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau took his wives and sons and daughters and all the members of his household, as well as his livestock and all his other animals and all the goods he had acquired in Canaan, and moved to a land some distance from his brother Jacob.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their possessions were too great for them to remain together; the land where they were staying could not support them both because of their livestock.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Esau (that is, Edom) settled in the hill country of Seir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the account of the family line of Esau the father of the Edomites in the hill country of Seir.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the names of Esau's sons:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 36:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliphaz, the son of Esau's wife Adah, and Reuel, the son of Esau's wife Basemath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Eliphaz:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 36:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Teman, Omar, Zepho, Gatam and Kenaz.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau's son Eliphaz also had a concubine named Timna, who bore him Amalek. These were grandsons of Esau's wife Adah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Reuel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 36:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nahath, Zerah, Shammah and Mizzah. These were grandsons of Esau's wife Basemath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Esau's wife Oholibamah daughter of Anah and granddaughter of Zibeon, whom she bore to Esau:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 36:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeush, Jalam and Korah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These were the chiefs among Esau's descendants:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "GEN 36:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Eliphaz the firstborn of Esau:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 36:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chiefs Teman, Omar, Zepho, Kenaz,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Gatam and Amalek. These were the chiefs descended from Eliphaz in Edom; they were grandsons of Adah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Esau's son Reuel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 36:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chiefs Nahath, Zerah, Shammah and Mizzah. These were the chiefs descended from Reuel in Edom; they were grandsons of Esau's wife Basemath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Esau's wife Oholibamah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 36:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chiefs Jeush, Jalam and Korah. These were the chiefs descended from Esau's wife Oholibamah daughter of Anah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These were the sons of Esau (that is, Edom), and these were their chiefs.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These were the sons of Seir the Horite, who were living in the region:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 36:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dishon, Ezer and Dishan. These sons of Seir in Edom were Horite chiefs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Lotan:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 36:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hori and Homam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Timna was Lotan's sister.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Shobal:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 36:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shepho and Onam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Zibeon:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 36:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aiah and Anah. (This is the Anah who discovered the hot springs",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.24",
